809 where when inserting a unicode character through either the menu or the keyboard alt method the `text_changed` signal is not emitted.\r\n\r\nWhen a unicode character is inserted in either of these ways, the `_text_changed` function, which emits the signal, was never called. I inserted calls to `_text_changed` after a unicode character was inserted in the problematic ways. This issue only exists in `LineEdit` and not in `TextEdit`. ","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-28T00:23:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T07:52:10Z","closed_at":"2025-09-28T03:07:41Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"682b4e64c268e545673039e974d7e535e8a353cf","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SmallConfusion:fix_unicode_signal","ref":"fix_unicode_signal","repo":{"id":1065540220,"node_id":"R_kgDOP4LafA","name":"godot","full_name":"SmallConfusion/godot","owner":{"login":"SmallConfusion","id":103614941,"node_id":"U_kgDOBi0J3Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103614941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion","html_url":"https://github.com/SmallConfusion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmallConfusion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sm